5,1,1,talk,Servas,,Let us begin with a spirit of openness. I wish to see the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think I should check the capital budget and software allowance, and maybe the vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I'm curious about the network coverage at customer plants! I'll check that and the handling of vendor queries.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will examine the misrouted deliveries in the incident logs and the time lost to copying existing records.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will look into in-house developer availability and the staffing of the coordination group.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
